@translation unitary en project
@unit 1
@span  i 1 - ii 7
For Ninŋešzida, his personal god, Gudea, ruler of Lagaš, the builder of Ninŋirsu's E-ninnu, fashioned his (own) statue, named it for his sake "(Gudea) made the temple worthy of (Ninŋešzida)", and brought it before him into the temple.




